# ---------------------------------------------------------------- reading every node

countNumbers is operation
countNumbers purpose "Count the number nodes in a node list"
countNumbers invariant countsNumbers "Returns how many nodes are numbers, reading every node once"
countNumbers typeParameter none
countNumbers input nodes Nodes borrowed
countNumbers output Int64
countNumbers outputOwnedBy none
countNumbers raises none
countNumbers effect none
countNumbers uses none
countNumbers memoryHeap false
countNumbers async false
countNumbers maxRecursion none
countNumbers label begin loopKind none
countNumbers label begin within none
countNumbers label visit note "The list's length is known only at run time, so the bound is that length, read before the loop"
countNumbers label visit loopKind forEach
countNumbers label visit within none
countNumbers label visit maxIterations nodeCount
countNumbers label visit over nodes
countNumbers label inspect loopKind none
countNumbers label inspect within visit
countNumbers label isNumber loopKind none
countNumbers label isNumber within visit
countNumbers label other loopKind none
countNumbers label other within visit
countNumbers label done loopKind none
countNumbers label done within none
countNumbers let one Int64 1 immutable
countNumbers let count Int64 0 mutable
countNumbers at begin do measure
countNumbers at begin goto visit
countNumbers at visit branch ifNext nodes bind node Expr goto inspect else goto done
countNumbers at inspect match node Expr
countNumbers at inspect case Expr.number bind number Int64 goto isNumber
countNumbers at inspect case Expr.name bind text String goto other
countNumbers at inspect case Expr.sum bind sumOperands Operands goto other
countNumbers at inspect case Expr.product bind productOperands Operands goto other
countNumbers at isNumber do addOne
countNumbers at isNumber set count nextCount
countNumbers at isNumber goto visit
countNumbers at other goto visit
countNumbers at done return ok count

