# ---------------------------------------------------------------- reading every name

joinNames is operation
joinNames purpose "Join the symbol table's names into one text, in the order they were first defined"
joinNames invariant definitionOrder "Returns every name once, in first-definition order, each followed by a comma"
joinNames typeParameter none
joinNames input symbols Symbols borrowed
joinNames input region Region borrowed
joinNames output String
joinNames outputOwnedBy region
joinNames raises none
joinNames effect none
joinNames uses none
joinNames memoryHeap true
joinNames async false
joinNames maxRecursion none
joinNames label begin loopKind none
joinNames label begin within none
joinNames label visit note "The table's size is known only at run time, so the bound is its length, read before the loop"
joinNames label visit loopKind forEach
joinNames label visit within none
joinNames label visit maxIterations nameCount
joinNames label visit over symbols
joinNames label append loopKind none
joinNames label append within visit
joinNames label done loopKind none
joinNames label done within none
joinNames let comma String "," immutable
joinNames let joined String "" mutable
joinNames at begin do countNames
joinNames at begin goto visit
joinNames at visit branch ifNext symbols bind name String goto append else goto done
joinNames at append do withName
joinNames at append do withComma
joinNames at append set joined withCommaText
joinNames at append goto visit
joinNames at done return ok joined

